<title>JAPAN: Tokyu Store -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyu Store -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		146.15		vs	  135.55</p>
<p> Operating	    3.33		vs	    3.09</p>
<p> Current		2.61		vs	    2.28</p>
<p> Net		    1.19		vs	    1.15</p>
<p> EPS		   16.90 yen	  vs	   16.37 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     70 million	  vs	  70 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.75 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyu Store Chain Co Ltd is a supermarket chain operator affiliated with Tokyu Corp.</p>
</text>
